{"title":"Combined feed","url":"https://Vinnl.github.io/feeds/all.xml","elements":[{"title":"Mamie Martin (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mamie_Martin\" title=\"Mamie Martin\">Mamie Martin</a></b> <i>(pictured)</i> died while her daughter was still a baby, but they are reunited near <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bandawe_Girls_Secondary_School\" title=\"Bandawe Girls Secondary School\">a school</a> funded by the charity they inspired?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mamie_Martin","retrieved":1787161865734},{"title":"Serbia Centre (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Serbia_Centre\" title=\"Serbia Centre\">Serbia Centre</a></b> is one of the political parties that supported the creation of a transitional government during <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2024–present_Serbian_anti-corruption_protests\" title=\"2024–present Serbian anti-corruption protests\">student-led protests in 2025</a>?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Serbia_Centre","retrieved":1787161865736},{"title":"Abdurrahman Mohammad Fachir (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Abdurrahman_Mohammad_Fachir\" title=\"Abdurrahman Mohammad Fachir\">Abdurrahman Mohammad Fachir</a></b> waited a month to tell his pregnant wife about his deployment to Baghdad?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Abdurrahman_Mohammad_Fachir","retrieved":1787161865736},{"title":"The Legend of Maula Jatt (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bilal_Lashari\" title=\"Bilal Lashari\">Bilal Lashari</a> rewrote the screenplay for <i><b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Legend_of_Maula_Jatt\" title=\"The Legend of Maula Jatt\">The Legend of Maula Jatt</a></b></i> 80 times?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Legend_of_Maula_Jatt","retrieved":1787161865738},{"title":"Yuvelis Morales Blanco (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that Goldman Prize winner <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Yuvelis_Morales_Blanco\" title=\"Yuvelis Morales Blanco\">Yuvelis Morales Blanco</a></b> was forced to flee to France due to her anti-fracking activism in her home of Colombia?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Yuvelis_Morales_Blanco","retrieved":1787161865740},{"title":"Fate/Extella Link (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <i><b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fate/Extella_Link\" title=\"Fate/Extella Link\">Fate/Extella Link</a></b></i>, featuring a gender-swapped version of the Roman emperor Nero, topped Japan's video-game sales charts upon its release?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fate/Extella_Link","retrieved":1787161865742},{"title":"a lo-fi song (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Clairo\" title=\"Clairo\">Clairo</a> did not set out to make <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pretty_Girl_(Clairo_song)\" title=\"Pretty Girl (Clairo song)\">a lo-fi song</a></b><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\">&nbsp;</span>– but her equipment was \"pretty shitty\"?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pretty_Girl_(Clairo_song)","retrieved":1787161865743},{"title":"Khirbet el-Hammam (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that the Roman siege system at <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Khirbet_el-Hammam_(Narbata)\" title=\"Khirbet el-Hammam (Narbata)\">Khirbet el-Hammam</a></b> has been described as having its closest parallel at <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Machaerus\" title=\"Machaerus\">Machaerus</a>?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Khirbet_el-Hammam_(Narbata)","retrieve